OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after three Jewish
OL,4,Awomen assaulted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old man accused of assaulting
OL,7,Fthree Jewish women in north-east London
OL,8,Fallegedly attacked one of the victims
OL,9,Fwhile she was pushing her baby in a
OL,10,Fpram, a court has heard.
OL,12,FAbdisamad Siad, of no fixed abode,
OL,13,Fappeared at Highbury Corner
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court charged with three
OL,15,Fcounts of assault by beating.
OL,17,FMagistrates heard the alleged offences
OL,18,Ftook place on Clapton Common, Hackney,
OL,19,Fon Monday when the first victim
OL,20,Freported being "slapped across the
OL,21,Fface" by a man at about 13:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
